{
  "id": "ep45-vo-07",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "v7_01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "圆明园十二兽首，你猜回来了几个？",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_01.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "袁明元十二授手你猜回来了几个",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "七个回了中国。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_02.mp3",
      "bytes": 29300,
      "heard": "七个回了中国",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.991,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可住回圆明园的，只有一个。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_03.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "可祝回元明元的只有一個",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "今年夏天，四个兽首去了杭州，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_04.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "今年夏天,四个授手去了杭州",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人们排了几个小时去看。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_05.mp3",
      "bytes": 36823,
      "heard": "人们排了几个小时去看",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "十二兽首，原本是喷泉的出水口。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_06.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "十二授手,原本是噴泉的出水口",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "它被带走了。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_09.mp3",
      "bytes": 23030,
      "heard": "他被带走了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.36
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一百多年后，它出现在伦敦。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_10.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "一百多年后,他出现在伦敦",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你猜，它卖了多少？",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_11.mp3",
      "bytes": 31807,
      "heard": "你猜他卖了多少",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "二零零七年，它又要上拍了。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_13.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "2007年,他又要上拍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "拍卖前，何鸿燊私下买下了它：",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_16.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "拍賣前,何宏申私下買下了他",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_23",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "何鸿燊，也把它捐给了国家。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_23.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "何洪深也把他捐给了国家",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_25",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他没等到，它回家的那天。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_25.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "他沒等到他回家的那天",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_27",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "它回到了圆明园。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_27.mp3",
      "bytes": 29300,
      "heard": "他回到了原名园",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_28",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "它离开了一百六十年。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_28.mp3",
      "bytes": 35569,
      "heard": "他离开了160年",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_29",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "它住进园里唯一没烧掉的古建筑。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_29.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "他住进原里唯一没烧掉的古建筑",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_30",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "细看，它是红铜一次铸成的。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_30.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "细看,它是红桐一次铸成的。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_31",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "只有一只耳朵，是卷的。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_31.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "只有一只耳朵是卷的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_32",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "研究的人说：它这一路被撞过。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_32.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "研究的人说,他这一路被撞过",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "v7_33",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "正午十二点，它们本该一起喷水。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "v7_33.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "正午12点,他们本该一起喷水",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.2
    }
  ],
